            {
                "comment": "Overall, the class was a fun time. The Professor was a blast to have and always in a good mood. I would recommend participating in class when he asks questions or thoughts to get a good grade for attendance and participation. He does have a little bit of broken English, but can still understand clearly. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "&#211;scar Useche is a really personable professor. He does a thorough job explaining course content to make sure we understand the content. He also has scheduled meetings to make sure you are understanding the content. He provides helpful feedback on work and is a flexible grader. Would want him as a professor again!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
